  "methodology": "Five isolated Node --expose-gc processes per engine and fixture size, rotated order, 30 warmups, 300 small / 15 large timed iterations, median across trials. Import excludes process launch. Retention holds 20 artifacts after explicit GC; MiniText render retains both AST and HTML, competitors retain HTML only. GC heap deltas are noisy, not peak RSS or allocation counts. No browser throughput claim. MiniText uses a smaller grammar, so results are workload-specific and not equivalent-compliance rankings. Baseline measurements use the untouched dist build of sourceCommit; sourceSHA256 is computed from that commit.",
